         chain); post-KitKat codepoints fall through to modern Noto. -->
    <string name="emoji_kitkat">KitKat-era (expect 2013 blobs):\n😀 😃 😄 😁 😆 😅 😂 😍 😎 😢 😭 👍 👏 ❤ ☀ ☕ 🍭</string>
    <string name="emoji_modern">Post-KitKat (expect modern Noto):\n🦄 🌮 🥑 🤖 🧟 🥳 🦖 🏳️‍🌈</string>
